<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36395" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνῡλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>involved</i> or <i>implicated in matter,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πάθη λόγοι ἔ. εἰσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					403a25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				195
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἔ. καὶ γεννητικὴ ψυχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					2.3.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				126
			</span></i> bis: 
				Comp.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				414
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					6.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Syrian.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				50.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wooded,</i>
			
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔναυλος</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.Did.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>involved in</i> loss by <i>wood,</i> i.e. by <i>fire,</i>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνυγρος</span>
			 IV.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
